# Pre-event research + local secrets — ignore everything listed below.
# Scratch app code will live outside these ignores when the build clock opens.

# Nothing under specs/ is ignored any more. The pre-event research was shared
# with the team on purpose, so it is tracked under specs/research/ and marked as
# superseded in specs/README.md rather than hidden.

